# musubi — .gitignore

# User config — contains project paths specific to your machine
# Use musubi.toml.example as the shareable template
# Per-bed configs (musubi.<bed>.toml) are personal too — config picker
# selects among them at launch.
musubi.toml
musubi.*.toml

# Virtual environment
.venv/

# Per-user Claude Code workspace (agent defs, hooks, GSD config)
# Contains user-specific absolute paths; not shipped with musubi.
.claude/

# Per-user Codex CLI workspace (agent defs, hook scripts, hooks.json)
# Contains user-specific absolute paths; not shipped with musubi.
.codex/

# Per-user agent skills (e.g. Codex source-command skills)
# Machine-local; not shipped with musubi.
.agents/

# Personal planning + codebase analysis scratchpad (e.g. /gsd:map-codebase output)
.planning/

# Author's internal working notes — IA queue, design drafts, spike prompts.
# Kept locally for the author's own use; not part of the shipped product.
# Public-facing equivalents live in docs/agents/ and docs/positioning/.
docs/operator/internal/

# Internal strategy sketches + maintainer release-prep — anonymised, but
# roadmap/positioning notes that aren't for public consumption.
docs/positioning/essays/v0.3-strategic-visual-sketch.md
docs/positioning/essays/receipts-first-skeptic-sketch.md
docs/operator/github-repo-metadata.md

# Active comms transcript — gitignored; archive committed copies to docs/agents/archive/
docs/agents/comms/

# oyakata-2 PreToolUse decision audit trail — per-session/per-cycle, machine-local.
# Operators should mirror this entry in their project's .gitignore (the hook
# writes to docs/agents/oyakata-decisions.md relative to the project root).
docs/agents/oyakata-decisions.md

# oyakata-2 slice 3 (tier-2) pending-decision request/verdict files. Per-call,
# ephemeral (deleted by the hook after verdict consumption). Operators should
# mirror this entry in their project's .gitignore.
docs/agents/oyakata-pending/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.Python
.pytest_cache/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# upgrade_project.py auto-backups (timestamped; safe to delete after verifying upgrade)
*.backup-*
.gstack/
